    "comment": {
      "comments": [
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12435121/comment/12752573",
          "id": "12752573",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=markrmiller%40gmail.com",
            "name": "markrmiller@gmail.com",
            "key": "markrmiller@gmail.com",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=markrmiller%40gmail.com&avatarId=17267",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=markrmiller%40gmail.com&avatarId=17267",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=markrmiller%40gmail.com&avatarId=17267",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=markrmiller%40gmail.com&avatarId=17267"
            },
            "displayName": "Mark Miller",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "body": "Yeah - could be more clear.\n\nI agree that there doesn't appear to be a need to mark it as expert. And I guess we should just remove the part that mentions its involved in the weight? Or re word.\n\n\"This is used as an approximation of the number of documents in the index for scoring calculations.\"\n\nOr something to that effect (namely, better). Perhaps approximation isnt even needed - \n\n\"Because un-merged deleted docs still contribute to index statistics, this is used as the number of documents in the index for scoring calculations.\"\n\nor ...",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=markrmiller%40gmail.com",
            "name": "markrmiller@gmail.com",
            "key": "markrmiller@gmail.com",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=markrmiller%40gmail.com&avatarId=17267",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=markrmiller%40gmail.com&avatarId=17267",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=markrmiller%40gmail.com&avatarId=17267",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=markrmiller%40gmail.com&avatarId=17267"
            },
            "displayName": "Mark Miller",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "created": "2009-09-08T15:32:27.783+0000",
          "updated": "2009-09-08T15:32:27.783+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12435121/comment/12752612",
          "id": "12752612",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=marvin",
            "name": "marvin",
            "key": "creamyg",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Marvin Humphrey",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/Los_Angeles"
          },
          "body": "maxDoc() isn't just used for calculating weights.  It's also used for e.g.\nfiguring out how big your bit vector needs to be in order to accommodate the\nlargest doc in the collection.\n\nMy vote would be to just strip that extra comment about calculating term\nweights.\n",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=marvin",
            "name": "marvin",
            "key": "creamyg",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Marvin Humphrey",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/Los_Angeles"
          },
          "created": "2009-09-08T17:17:58.618+0000",
          "updated": "2009-09-08T17:17:58.618+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12435121/comment/12752618",
          "id": "12752618",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=markrmiller%40gmail.com",
            "name": "markrmiller@gmail.com",
            "key": "markrmiller@gmail.com",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=markrmiller%40gmail.com&avatarId=17267",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=markrmiller%40gmail.com&avatarId=17267",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=markrmiller%40gmail.com&avatarId=17267",
